  "**You destroyed Leviathan and you won the map, amazing! **": {
    "translation": "**你摧毁了利维坦,还赢得了地图,太棒了!**"
  },
  "**Try your destiny on the final secret level!**": {
    "translation": "**在最终秘密关卡上试试你的命运!**"
  },
  "**Zombie detected, you lose!**": {
    "translation": "**发现僵尸,你输了!**"
  },
  "**You have beaten Mt Bur Omisace!! Congratulations !! **": {
    "translation": "**你已经击败了布尔奥米萨克山!!恭喜!!**"
  },
  "**Gates will open in 15 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**大门将在15秒后打开!**"
  },
  "**Judge Gabranth vanquished!**": {
    "translation": "**加布兰斯法官败北!**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Blizzaga Magick!**": {
    "translation": "**Gabranth 已经施放了 Blizzaga 魔法!**"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan vanquished!**": {
    "translation": "**伯根法官战败!**"
  },
  "**Bergan has casted Firaga Magick!**": {
    "translation": "**伯根施展了菲拉加魔法!**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath is dead, run!**": {
    "translation": "**扎尔加巴斯死了,快跑!**"
  },
  "**Nades do more damage**": {
    "translation": "**手榴弹造成更多伤害**"
  },
  "**Gates will open in 23 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**大门将在23秒后打开!**"
  },
  "**It's old Airship, we can use him to escape!**": {
    "translation": "**这是老飞艇,我们可以利用他逃跑!**"
  },
  "**Something incoming, prepare to fight!**": {
    "translation": "**有东西来袭,准备战斗!**"
  },
  "**Gates will close in 5 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**大门将在5秒后关闭!**"
  },
  "**Metal doors will open in 10 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**金属门将在10秒后打开!**"
  },
  "**Defend here until teleport will enable!**": {
    "translation": "**在这里防守,直到传送开启!**"
  },
  "**Insane mode was beaten. Unlocking Legend mode**": {
    "translation": "**疯狂模式已通关.解锁传奇模式**"
  },
  "**We escaped with look...**": {
    "translation": "**我们带着一丝目光逃脱......**"
  },
  "**Imperial Army sends the most dangerous Airship**": {
    "translation": "**帝国陆军派出最危险的飞艇**"
  },
  "**Dreadnought Leviathan!?**": {
    "translation": "**无畏舰利维坦!?**"
  },
  "**We have to destroy the airship before they manage to land**": {
    "translation": "**我们必须在他们降落之前摧毁飞艇**"
  },
  "**Hold this area for 15 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**保持此区域15秒!**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**Defend here until random gatest will open!**>20.00>1": {
    "translation": "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**在此防守,直到随机 gatest 打开!**>20.00>1"
  },
  "**Dreadnought Leviathan is nearby Kiltian Temple**": {
    "translation": "**无畏巨兽就在基尔提安神庙附近**"
  },
  "**There is a chance that the teleport in the temple may connect to the airship**": {
    "translation": "**神殿里的传送器有可能与飞船相连**"
  },
  "**Run, don't get killed, the further fate of this place depends on you, you can't lose!**": {
    "translation": "**快跑,别被杀,这个地方的未来命运取决于你,你不能输!**"
  },
  "**The alarm should cease after a time, but it's better to avoid drawing unnecessary attention**": {
    "translation": "**闹钟过一段时间后应该停止,但最好避免引起不必要的注意**"
  },
  "**Break one of those beams and an alarm will sound, summoning the guard**": {
    "translation": "**打断其中一根光束报警器会响,召唤守卫**"
  },
  "**It is a mechanism to detect intruder within the ship**": {
    "translation": "**这是监测船内入侵者的机制**"
  },
  "**See that red web of light spanning the passage way?**": {
    "translation": "**看到横跨通道的红色光网了吗?**"
  },
  "**Wait. A word of caution before we set out**": {
    "translation": "**等等.在出发前先提醒一句**"
  },
  "**Elevator is disabled, we must turn on power manually**": {
    "translation": "**电梯已停用,我们必须手动开启电源**"
  },
  "**Find switch and defend until elevator starts moving**": {
    "translation": "**找到开关并防守,直到电梯开始移动**"
  },
  "**The Elevator will start in 12 seconds": {
    "translation": "**电梯将在12秒后启动**"
  },
  "**We got the power. The elevator is enable!**": {
    "translation": "**我们已接通电源,电梯已启用!**"
  },
  "**GIM52A has been summoned to judge us!*": {
    "translation": "**GIM52A已被召唤来审判我们!**"
  },
  "**Defeat him before he kills us!**": {
    "translation": "**在他杀了我们之前击败他!**"
  },
  "**Hold here for 10 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**在这里坚持10秒!**"
  },
  "**Defend until the gates is open!**": {
    "translation": "**防守直到大门打开!**"
  },
  "Gates will open in 30 seconds!": {
    "translation": "大门将在30秒后打开!"
  },
  "**Bergan has casted Cure Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan施放了治愈魔法**"
  },
  "**Bergan has casted Water Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan施放了水系魔法**"
  },
  "**Bergan has casted Beam Ability**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan施放了光束技能**"
  },
  "**Bergan has casted Firaga Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan施放了烈焰魔法**"
  },
  "**Bergan has casted Gravity Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan施放了重力魔法**"
  },
  "**Run away from Bergan!**": {
    "translation": "**远离Bergan!**"
  },
  "**remember this place is not real, but his attacks are!**": {
    "translation": "**记住这个地方不真实,但他的攻击是真的!**"
  },
  "**Judge Berganteleported us to his dimension!": {
    "translation": "**审判者Bergan将我们传送到他的空间!**"
  },
  "**Some of the items can affect him. Use them!**": {
    "translation": "**一些道具可以影响他.使用它们!**"
  },
  "**Defend until the path is clear!**": {
    "translation": "**防守直到道路清空!**"
  },
  "**Defend here until doors will close!**": {
    "translation": "**在这里防守直到门关闭!**"
  },
  "**Hard mode was beaten. Unlocking Extreme mode **": {
    "translation": "**困难模式已通关.解锁极限模式**"
  },
  "**Look at his Gates, we should be able to open them**": {
    "translation": "**看他的门,我们应该能打开它们**"
  },
  "**Hold this area for 35 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**把这一片区域守住35秒!**"
  },
  "**It's not shortcut but ancient gem room!**": {
    "translation": "**这不是捷径,而是远古宝石房!**"
  },
  "**Snow Dragon has casted Ice Tornado!**": {
    "translation": "**雪龙施放了冰旋风!**"
  },
  "**Snow Dragon begins to channel DEATH AND DOOM into the area! DON'T STAY ON THE MIDDLE!**": {
    "translation": "**雪龙开始向该区域引导死亡与毁灭!不要呆在中间!**"
  },
  "**Snow Dragon has casted Fire Beam**": {
    "translation": "**雪龙施放了火焰光束**"
  },
  "**Snow Dragon has casted Ice Shield, Stop shooting, you only healing him!**": {
    "translation": "**雪龙施放了冰盾,停止射击,你只会治疗他!**"
  },
  "**Snow Dragon has casted Cure Magick!**": {
    "translation": "**雪龙施放了治愈魔法!**"
  },
  "**Snow Dragon has casted Ice Missile!**": {
    "translation": "**雪龙施放了冰导弹!**"
  },
  "**Snow Dragon has casted Poison Explosion!**": {
    "translation": "**雪龙施放了毒爆!**"
  },
  "**Snow Dragon has casted Flame Breath Explosion!**": {
    "translation": "**雪龙施放了烈焰吐息爆炸!**"
  },
  "**Snow Dragon has been defeated!**": {
    "translation": "**雪龙已被击败!**"
  },
  "**Take Blue Crystal, his power can help us in future!**": {
    "translation": "**拿起蓝色水晶,他的力量将来会帮助我们!**"
  },
  "**The Fence will open in 10 seconds**": {
    "translation": "**围栏将在10秒后打开**"
  },
  "**Wait until something happens**": {
    "translation": "**等待事件发生**"
  },
  "**Gates will open in 20 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**传送门将在20秒后打开!**"
