    "translation": "**欢迎来到布尔.奥米萨斯山**"
  },
  "**Extreme mode was beaten. Unlocking Insane mode**": {
    "translation": "**极限模式已通关.正在解锁疯狂模式**"
  },
  "**Shadow blocking the way, we must defeat him! shoot**": {
    "translation": "**阴影挡住了路,我们必须打败它!开火**"
  },
  "**That Shadow!**": {
    "translation": "**那个阴影!**"
  },
  "**The Armory room will open in 8 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**兵器库将在8秒钟后打开!**"
  },
  "**Judge Ghis couldn't have gone far, most likely running to the hangar**": {
    "translation": "**吉斯法官不会走得太远,很可能跑向机库**"
  },
  "**We have to get out of here as soon as possible!**": {
    "translation": "**我们必须尽快离开这里!**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath wants to destroy leviathan with us**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯想和我们一起摧毁利维坦**"
  },
  "**One of the engines gonna explode!?**": {
    "translation": "**其中一个引擎要爆炸了!?**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath vanquished, keep running!**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯被击败,继续跑!**"
  },
  "**Defend until something gonna happen!!**": {
    "translation": "**防守直到有事情发生!**"
  },
  "**Defend until teleport is enable!**": {
    "translation": "**防守直到传送可用!**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath has casted Tornado Magick**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯施放了龙卷风魔法**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath has casted Protect Magick**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯施放了防护魔法**"
  },
  "**Don't stay on the middle!**": {
    "translation": "**不要站在中间!**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath has casted Fire Attack**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯施放了火焰攻击**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath has casted Cure Magick**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯施放了治疗魔法**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath has casted Vampire Ability**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯施放了吸血鬼技能**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath has casted Ultimate Attack**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯施放了终极攻击**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath is using Dark Magick**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯正在使用黑暗魔法**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath has casted Damage Attack**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯施放了伤害攻击**"
  },
  "**Zargabaath has casted Thunder Ability**": {
    "translation": "**扎加巴斯施放了雷电技能**"
  },
  "**Gates will open in 20 seconds**": {
    "translation": "**大门将在20秒后打开**"
  },
  "**Gates are closed, we need to find another way!**": {
    "translation": "**大门关闭了,我们需要找另一条路!**"
  },
  "**Gates will open in 35 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**大门将在35秒后打开!**"
  },
  "**Airship going to explode, we must get out of here, run!**": {
    "translation": "**飞船要爆炸了,我们必须离开这里,快跑!**"
  },
  "**Jude Zargabaath escape, we have to catch him!**": {
    "translation": "**裘德.扎加巴斯逃走了,我们必须抓住他!**"
  },
  "**Some of the items can affect Zargabaath. Use them!**": {
    "translation": "**一些道具可以影响扎加巴斯.使用它们!**"
  },
  "**Random way will unlock in 10 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**随机通道将在10秒后解锁!**"
  },
  "**Way has been unlock, keep running!**": {
    "translation": "**通道已解锁,继续跑!**"
  },
  "**Defend here until gates will open!**": {
    "translation": "**在这里防守直到大门打开!**"
  },
  "**Gates are open!**": {
    "translation": "**大门已打开!**"
  },
  "**Engine room will open in 15 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**引擎室将在15秒后打开!**"
  },
  "**Defent until way will open!**": {
    "translation": "**防守直到通道打开!**"
  },
  "**Elevator will enable in 14 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**电梯将在14秒后启动!**"
  },
  "**Gates will open in 30 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**大门将在30秒后打开!**"
  },
  "**Gates will close in 15 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**大门将在15秒后关闭!**"
  },
  "**Hard mode was beaten. Unlocking extreme mode**": {
    "translation": "**困难模式已通关.解锁极限模式**"
  },
  "**Wait 5 seconds more!**": {
    "translation": "**再等5秒!**"
  },
  "**Nobody has been in these ruins for a long time**": {
    "translation": "**很久没人踏入这些废墟**"
  },
  "**Find an unlocked door, maybe you can open it!**": {
    "translation": "**找到一扇未上锁的门,也许你能打开它!**"
  },
  "**First let's try to go left, better go down!**": {
    "translation": "**先尝试向左走,最好向下!**"
  },
  "**Bridge exploded, hurry find another way!**": {
    "translation": "**桥梁爆炸了,快找另一条路!**"
  },
  "**GO GO GO!!**": {
    "translation": "**快,快,快!!**"
  },
  "**Defend this place for 20 seconds**": {
    "translation": "**防守这个地方20秒**"
  },
  "**We can run away from this empty tower**": {
    "translation": "**我们可以从这座空塔逃走**"
  },
  "**Hopefully Gran Kiltias Anastasis is safe**": {
    "translation": "**希望大祭司安纳斯塔西斯安全**"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan should be dead but with them you never know, let's hope we never meet him again**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan法官应该已经死了,但有他们在你永远不知道,希望我们再也不要遇到他**"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan vanquished**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan法官已被击败**"
  },
  "**Bergan has casted Ultima Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan施放了终极魔法**"
  },
  "**Get away from Bergan!**": {
    "translation": "**离Bergan远点!**"
  },
  "**Bergan has casted Fire Ability**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan施放了火焰能力**"
  },
  "**Stay away from Bergan!**": {
    "translation": "**远离Bergan!**"
  },
  "**Bergan has casted Blizzard Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan施放了暴风雪魔法**"
  },
  "**Bergan has casted Energy Ability**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan施放了能量能力**"
  },
  "**When we were in the Stilshrine of Miriam we could see smoke coming from that area**": {
    "translation": "**当我们在米利安神殿时,我们可以看到那片地区冒出烟雾**"
  },
  "**We have to check it out, we'll meet with Gran Kiltias Anastasis**": {
    "translation": "**我们必须去检查一下,我们将与大祭司Anastasis会面**"
  },
  "**Anyway, we need to meet him!**": {
    "translation": "**无论如何,我们需要见他!**"
  },
  "**We need to get to him asap, we won't move on without his help**": {
    "translation": "**我们必须尽快找到他,没有他的帮助我们无法继续**"
  },
  "**Find way to main temple and talk with Gran Kiltias Anastasis**": {
    "translation": "**找到通往主神殿的路并与大祭司 Anastasis 交谈**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**Don't let them escape!**>7.00>1": {
    "translation": "**不要让他们逃跑!**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**Impasible Judge Bergan and Gabranth we must stop them!**>5.00>1": {
    "translation": "不可阻挡的Bergan和Gabranth,我们必须阻止他们!**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**Wait what's that?**>3.00>1": {
    "translation": "**等等,那是什么?**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**The left gate is closed! We must open nearby one**>17.00>1": {
    "translation": "**左门关闭了!我们必须打开附近的门**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**Hold this area until gate open!**>19.00>1": {
    "translation": "**守住这个区域直到门打开!**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**No matter how strong he is we have to beat him or else mt bur-omisace will be destroyed!**>13.00>1": {
    "translation": "**不管他有多强,我们必须击败他,否则我的山-奥米萨斯将被毁!**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**This may be our only opportunity to fight him**>10.00>1": {
    "translation": "**这可能是我们唯一的机会去对抗他**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**That's why he's so powerful some he has several that's why he is so dangerous**>7.00>1": {
    "translation": "**这就是他如此强大的原因,他有好几个力量,这也是他如此危险的原因**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**Supposedly he have a limit breaker!**>5.00>1": {
    "translation": "**据说他有极限突破!**"
  },
  "OnTrigger>cmd>Command>**Apparently Judge Gabranth is hiding in this part of the tower!**>3.00>1": {
    "translation": "**显然Gabranth法官隐藏在塔的这一部分!**"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan probably went to the room where Gran Kiltias Anastasis is staying!**": {
    "translation": "**Bergan 法官可能去了大祭司 Anastasis 所在的房间!**"
  },
  "**Don't let him hurt Anastasis, you need to hurry up!**": {
    "translation": "**不要让他伤害Anastasis,你需要快点!**"
  },
  "**I hope the soldiers of the empire will not disturb us**": {
    "translation": "**希望帝国的士兵不会打扰我们**"
  },
  "**Cover here for 15 seconds before we clear this obstacle**": {
    "translation": "**在我们清除这个障碍之前,在这里防守15秒**"
  },
  "**Hold here for 13 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**在这里坚持13秒!**"
  },
  "**Gates will open in 25 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**大门将在 25 秒后开启!**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Meteor Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Gabranth施放了陨石魔法**"
  },
  "**Keep moving!**": {
    "translation": "**继续前进!**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Protect Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Gabranth施放了保护魔法**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Cure Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Gabranth施放了治疗魔法**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Blizzard Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Gabranth施放了暴风雪魔法**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Shine Magick**": {
    "translation": "**Gabranth施放了闪耀魔法**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Wave of Fear**": {
    "translation": "**Gabranth施放了恐惧波**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Double Damage**": {
    "translation": "**Gabranth施放了双倍伤害**"
  },
  "**Stay away from Gabranth!**": {
    "translation": "**远离加布兰特!**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Vampire Ability**": {
    "translation": "**加布兰特施放了吸血鬼技能**"
  },
  "**Stop shooting!**": {
    "translation": "**停止射击!**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Slow Magick**": {
    "translation": "**加布兰特施放了减速魔法**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Ultima Magick**": {
    "translation": "**加布兰特施放了终极魔法**"
  },
  "**Get away from Gabranth!**": {
    "translation": "**离开加布兰特!**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Vulcan Magick**": {
    "translation": "**加布兰特施放了火山魔法**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Energy Ability**": {
    "translation": "**加布兰特施放了能量技能**"
  },
  "**Stay in the middle!**": {
    "translation": "**待在中间!**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Thunder Ability**": {
    "translation": "**加布兰特施放了雷电技能**"
  },
  "**Gabranth has casted Gravity Magick**": {
    "translation": "**加布兰特施放了重力魔法**"
  },
  "**Run away from Gabranth!**": {
    "translation": "**从加布兰特那里跑开!**"
  },
  "**Judge Gabranth vanquished, keep running!**": {
    "translation": "**审判官加布兰特被击败,继续奔跑!**"
  },
  "**We took control of the stone, it may be useful later**": {
    "translation": "**我们控制了石头,它以后可能有用**"
  },
  "**We have to get to the exit, we can't go back, so keep running**": {
    "translation": "**我们必须到出口,不能回头,所以继续跑**"
  },
  "**Hold here for 20 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "**在这里坚持20秒!**"
  },
  "Map By Ma/l/go": {
    "translation": "地图作者:Ma/l/go"
  },
  "ze_ffxii_Mt_Bur_Omisace": {
    "translation": "ze_ffxii_Mt_Bur_Omisace"
